      "content": "the problem is that \"taking a break\" doesnt work. i try to sleep, i try to sit in a dark room, i try everything, but it never actually goes away. it feels like it's just built into everything. i just feel so heavy and tired of fighting it. i want a way to actually make the noise stop once and for all. not just for an hour, but forever.",
